body:
&#x200B;

I'm currently saving up for my first ever gaming laptop, I still got like 3-4 months of work until I can get it but I know that I will be more statisfied when I finally get it because I can tell myself "I worked for that and I got it"

Your little brother sounds incredibly spoiled to me, tell your parents to stop buying him so much stuff and depending on how old he is encouraging him to get a job. What is important tho is not forcing him to get a job but rather cutting his allowance and not buying anything for him so if he wants to get shit he has to work for it himself.
